      "content": "what are you talking about with the goblins? i'm not looking for metaphors, i need a technical diagnostic. \n\ncan we just look at the data? the jitter is concentrated specifically between hop 2 (172.16.5.1) and hop 3 (198.51.100.1). given the 45ms jitter, does that point to an interface issue on the 172.16.5.1 router, or is it more likely congestion in the provider backbone?",
